PTX tearing+weak
"As tearing+relaxed with weak accesses: a data race of same-size accesses, no single-copy atomicity. Expected: allowed."
{
x[0]=0;
x[1]=0;
P1:r0[0]=0;
P1:r0[1]=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0   | P1@cta 1,gpu 0    ;
 st.weak.b32 x, 1 | ld.weak.b32 r0, x ;
exists
(P1:r0[0] == 1 /\ P1:r0[1] == 0)
